# Tidegrid reads no configuration and requires no environment variables at all:
# the station file (--file, default station.json) is the only input it needs.
#
# The single variable it honours is the conventional NO_COLOR. Leave it empty for the
# default behaviour (colour on a terminal, plain text when piped or redirected); set it
# to any value to force plain output. The --no-color flag does the same per invocation.
NO_COLOR=
